# The Debian images the installation ISOs are made from
# (scripts/build-iso.sh), one per architecture, each pinned by its SHA512
# from cdimage.debian.org's SHA512SUMS of that architecture
# (debian-cd/<version>/<arch>/iso-cd/). A newer point release is taken by
# changing the version and both checksums.
